# Generated plans and the company's own parameters are confidential
# business data and stay out of git by default, so a public fork never
# leaks a real company's numbers. To version them, use a PRIVATE
# repository or protected storage and delete the three lines below
# deliberately.
plan/*
!plan/README.md
company/params.yaml
company/params.yml
company/params.json
company/*.local.yaml
company/*.local.json

node_modules/
.DS_Store

# Secrets never belong in this repository. Connector API keys live in
# environment variables the client expands at launch; see docs/CONNECTORS.md.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
